{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Communication Protocols Notebook\n\n> Hands-on Build It and Exercises."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Build It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 1: Core Message Types"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Every multi-agent system starts with a message format. We define types that map to what the real protocols use:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```typescript"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "import crypto from \"node:crypto\";"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type MessageRole = \"user\" | \"agent\";"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type MessagePart ="
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  | { kind: \"text\"; text: string }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  | { kind: \"data\"; data: unknown; mediaType: string }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  | { kind: \"file\"; name: string; url: string; mediaType: string };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type TrajectoryEntry = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  reasoning: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  toolName?: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  toolInput?: unknown;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  toolOutput?: unknown;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  timestamp: number;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "};"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type AgentMessage = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  id: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  role: MessageRole;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  parts: MessagePart[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  trajectory?: TrajectoryEntry[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  replyTo?: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  timestamp: number;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "};"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "function createMessage("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  role: MessageRole,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  parts: MessagePart[],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  replyTo?: string"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "): AgentMessage {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  return {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    id: crypto.randomUUID(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    role,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    parts,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    replyTo,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    timestamp: Date.now(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "function textMessage(role: MessageRole, text: string): AgentMessage {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  return createMessage(role, [{ kind: \"text\", text }]);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Notice: `MessagePart` is multimodal (text, structured data, files) just like the real A2A and ACP specs. `TrajectoryEntry` captures the reasoning chain, matching ACP's TrajectoryMetadata."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 2: A2A Agent Card and Registry"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Build agent discovery that matches the real A2A spec:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```typescript"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type Skill = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  id: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  name: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  description: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  tags: string[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  inputModes: string[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  outputModes: string[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "};"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type AgentCard = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  name: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  description: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  version: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  url: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  capabilities: {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    streaming: boolean;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    pushNotifications: boolean;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  defaultInputModes: string[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  defaultOutputModes: string[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  skills: Skill[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "};"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class AgentRegistry {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  private cards: Map<string, AgentCard> = new Map();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  register(card: AgentCard) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    this.cards.set(card.name, card);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  discoverBySkillTag(tag: string): AgentCard[] {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return [...this.cards.values()].filter((card) =>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      card.skills.some((skill) => skill.tags.includes(tag))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    );"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  discoverByInputMode(mimeType: string): AgentCard[] {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return [...this.cards.values()].filter("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      (card) =>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        card.defaultInputModes.includes(mimeType) ||"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        card.skills.some((skill) => skill.inputModes.includes(mimeType))"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    );"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  resolve(name: string): AgentCard | undefined {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return this.cards.get(name);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  listAll(): AgentCard[] {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return [...this.cards.values()];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "This is substantially richer than a simple name-to-capability map. You can discover agents by skill tags, by input MIME types, or by name, just like the real A2A spec supports."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 3: A2A Task Lifecycle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Build the full task state machine:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```typescript"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type TaskState ="
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  | \"submitted\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  | \"working\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  | \"input-required\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  | \"auth-required\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  | \"completed\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  | \"failed\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  | \"canceled\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  | \"rejected\";"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "const TERMINAL_STATES: TaskState[] = ["
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  \"completed\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  \"failed\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  \"canceled\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  \"rejected\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type TaskStatus = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  state: TaskState;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  message?: AgentMessage;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  timestamp: number;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "};"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type Artifact = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  id: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  name: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  parts: MessagePart[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "};"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type Task = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  id: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  contextId: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  status: TaskStatus;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  artifacts: Artifact[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  history: AgentMessage[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "};"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type TaskEvent ="
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  | { kind: \"statusUpdate\"; taskId: string; status: TaskStatus }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  | {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      kind: \"artifactUpdate\";"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      taskId: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      artifact: Artifact;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      append: boolean;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      lastChunk: boolean;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type TaskHandler = ("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  task: Task,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  message: AgentMessage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        ") => AsyncGenerator<TaskEvent>;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class TaskManager {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  private tasks: Map<string, Task> = new Map();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  private handlers: Map<string, TaskHandler> = new Map();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  private listeners: Map<string, ((event: TaskEvent) => void)[]> = new Map();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  registerHandler(agentName: string, handler: TaskHandler) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    this.handlers.set(agentName, handler);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  subscribe(taskId: string, listener: (event: TaskEvent) => void) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const existing = this.listeners.get(taskId) ?? [];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    existing.push(listener);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    this.listeners.set(taskId, existing);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  async sendMessage("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    agentName: string,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    message: AgentMessage,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    contextId?: string"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  ): Promise<Task> {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const handler = this.handlers.get(agentName);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if (!handler) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      const task = this.createTask(contextId);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      task.status = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        state: \"rejected\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        timestamp: Date.now(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        message: textMessage(\"agent\", `No handler for ${agentName}`),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      return task;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const task = this.createTask(contextId);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    task.history.push(message);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    task.status = { state: \"submitted\", timestamp: Date.now() };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    this.processTask(task, handler, message).catch((err) => {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      task.status = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        state: \"failed\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        timestamp: Date.now(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        message: textMessage(\"agent\", String(err)),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    });"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return task;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  getTask(taskId: string): Task | undefined {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return this.tasks.get(taskId);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  cancelTask(taskId: string): boolean {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const task = this.tasks.get(taskId);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if (!task || TERMINAL_STATES.includes(task.status.state)) return false;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    task.status = { state: \"canceled\", timestamp: Date.now() };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    this.emit(taskId, {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      kind: \"statusUpdate\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      taskId,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      status: task.status,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    });"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return true;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  private createTask(contextId?: string): Task {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const task: Task = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      id: crypto.randomUUID(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      contextId: contextId ?? crypto.randomUUID(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      status: { state: \"submitted\", timestamp: Date.now() },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      artifacts: [],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      history: [],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    this.tasks.set(task.id, task);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return task;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  private async processTask("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    task: Task,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    handler: TaskHandler,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    message: AgentMessage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  ) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    task.status = { state: \"working\", timestamp: Date.now() };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    this.emit(task.id, {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      kind: \"statusUpdate\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      taskId: task.id,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      status: task.status,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    });"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    try {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      for await (const event of handler(task, message)) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if (TERMINAL_STATES.includes(task.status.state)) break;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if (event.kind === \"statusUpdate\") {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "          task.status = event.status;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        if (event.kind === \"artifactUpdate\") {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "          const existing = task.artifacts.find("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            (a) => a.id === event.artifact.id"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "          );"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "          if (existing && event.append) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            existing.parts.push(...event.artifact.parts);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "          } else {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "            task.artifacts.push(event.artifact);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "          }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        this.emit(task.id, event);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    } catch (err) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      task.status = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        state: \"failed\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        timestamp: Date.now(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        message: textMessage(\"agent\", String(err)),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      this.emit(task.id, {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        kind: \"statusUpdate\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        taskId: task.id,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        status: task.status,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      });"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  private emit(taskId: string, event: TaskEvent) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for (const listener of this.listeners.get(taskId) ?? []) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      listener(event);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "This implements the real A2A task lifecycle: submitted, working, input-required, terminal states. Handlers are async generators that yield events (status updates and artifact chunks) matching the SSE streaming model."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 4: ACP-Style Audit Trail"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Wrap communication with trajectory tracking:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```typescript"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type AuditEntry = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  runId: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  agentName: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  input: AgentMessage[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  output: AgentMessage[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  trajectory: TrajectoryEntry[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  status: \"created\" | \"in-progress\" | \"completed\" | \"failed\" | \"awaiting\";"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  startedAt: number;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  completedAt?: number;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  sessionId?: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "};"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class AuditableRunner {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  private log: AuditEntry[] = [];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  private handlers: Map<"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    string,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    (input: AgentMessage[]) => Promise<{"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      output: AgentMessage[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      trajectory: TrajectoryEntry[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  > = new Map();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  registerAgent("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    name: string,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    handler: (input: AgentMessage[]) => Promise<{"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      output: AgentMessage[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      trajectory: TrajectoryEntry[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  ) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    this.handlers.set(name, handler);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  async run("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    agentName: string,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    input: AgentMessage[],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    sessionId?: string"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  ): Promise<AuditEntry> {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const entry: AuditEntry = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      runId: crypto.randomUUID(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      agentName,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      input: structuredClone(input),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      output: [],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      trajectory: [],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      status: \"created\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      startedAt: Date.now(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      sessionId,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    this.log.push(entry);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const handler = this.handlers.get(agentName);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if (!handler) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      entry.status = \"failed\";"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      return entry;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    entry.status = \"in-progress\";"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    try {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      const result = await handler(input);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      entry.output = structuredClone(result.output);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      entry.trajectory = structuredClone(result.trajectory);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      entry.status = \"completed\";"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      entry.completedAt = Date.now();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    } catch (err) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      entry.status = \"failed\";"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      entry.trajectory.push({"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        reasoning: `Error: ${String(err)}`,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        timestamp: Date.now(),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      });"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      entry.completedAt = Date.now();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return entry;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  getFullAuditLog(): AuditEntry[] {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return structuredClone(this.log);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  getAuditLogForAgent(agentName: string): AuditEntry[] {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return structuredClone("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      this.log.filter((e) => e.agentName === agentName)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    );"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  getAuditLogForSession(sessionId: string): AuditEntry[] {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return structuredClone("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      this.log.filter((e) => e.sessionId === sessionId)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    );"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  getTrajectoryForRun(runId: string): TrajectoryEntry[] {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const entry = this.log.find((e) => e.runId === runId);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return entry ? structuredClone(entry.trajectory) : [];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Every agent execution produces a full audit entry: what went in, what came out, and the complete trajectory of tool calls and reasoning steps in between. You can query by agent, by session, or by individual run."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 5: ANP-Style Identity Verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Build DID-based identity and verification:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```typescript"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type VerificationMethod = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  id: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  type: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  controller: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  publicKeyDer: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "};"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type DIDDocument = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  id: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  verificationMethod: VerificationMethod[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  authentication: string[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  keyAgreement: string[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  humanAuthorization: string[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  service: { id: string; type: string; serviceEndpoint: string }[];"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "};"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "type AgentIdentity = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  did: string;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  document: DIDDocument;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  privateKey: crypto.KeyObject;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  publicKey: crypto.KeyObject;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "};"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class IdentityRegistry {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  private documents: Map<string, DIDDocument> = new Map();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  publish(doc: DIDDocument) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    this.documents.set(doc.id, doc);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  resolve(did: string): DIDDocument | undefined {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return this.documents.get(did);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  verify(did: string, signature: string, payload: string): boolean {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const doc = this.documents.get(did);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if (!doc) return false;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const authKeyIds = doc.authentication;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const authKeys = doc.verificationMethod.filter((vm) =>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      authKeyIds.includes(vm.id)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    );"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    for (const key of authKeys) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      const publicKey = crypto.createPublicKey({"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        key: Buffer.from(key.publicKeyDer, \"base64\"),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        format: \"der\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        type: \"spki\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      });"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      const isValid = crypto.verify("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        null,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        Buffer.from(payload),"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        publicKey,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        Buffer.from(signature, \"hex\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      );"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      if (isValid) return true;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return false;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  requiresHumanAuth(did: string, operationKeyId: string): boolean {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const doc = this.documents.get(did);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if (!doc) return false;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return doc.humanAuthorization.includes(operationKeyId);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "function createIdentity(domain: string, agentName: string): AgentIdentity {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const did = `did:wba:${domain}:agent:${agentName}`;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const { publicKey, privateKey } = crypto.generateKeyPairSync(\"ed25519\");"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const publicKeyDer = publicKey"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    .export({ format: \"der\", type: \"spki\" })"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    .toString(\"base64\");"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const keyId = `${did}#key-1`;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const encKeyId = `${did}#key-x25519-1`;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const document: DIDDocument = {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    id: did,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    verificationMethod: ["
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        id: keyId,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        type: \"Ed25519VerificationKey2020\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        controller: did,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        publicKeyDer,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        id: encKeyId,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        type: \"X25519KeyAgreementKey2019\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        controller: did,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        publicKeyDer,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    ],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    authentication: [keyId],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    keyAgreement: [encKeyId],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    humanAuthorization: [],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    service: ["
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        id: `${did}#agent-description`,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        type: \"AgentDescription\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        serviceEndpoint: `https://${domain}/agents/${agentName}/ad.json`,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      },"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    ],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  return { did, document, privateKey, publicKey };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "function signPayload(identity: AgentIdentity, payload: string): string {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  return crypto"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    .sign(null, Buffer.from(payload), identity.privateKey)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    .toString(\"hex\");"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "This mirrors the real ANP identity model: agents have DID documents with separate authentication, key agreement, and human authorization keys. The `IdentityRegistry` simulates DID resolution (in production this would be HTTP fetches to the agent's domain)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 6: Protocol Gateway"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Connect all four protocols into a unified system:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```mermaid"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "graph LR"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    REQ[Incoming Request] --> ANP_V{ANP: Verify DID}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    ANP_V -->|Valid| A2A_D{A2A: Discover Agent}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    ANP_V -->|Invalid| REJECT[Reject]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    A2A_D -->|Found| ACP_A[ACP: Audit Run]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    A2A_D -->|Not Found| REJECT"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    ACP_A --> A2A_T[A2A: Create Task]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    A2A_T --> RESULT[Task + Audit Entry]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    style ANP_V fill:#d1fae5,stroke:#059669"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    style A2A_D fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    style ACP_A fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    style A2A_T fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```typescript"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "class ProtocolGateway {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  private registry: AgentRegistry;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  private taskManager: TaskManager;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  private auditRunner: AuditableRunner;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  private identityRegistry: IdentityRegistry;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  constructor("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    registry: AgentRegistry,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    taskManager: TaskManager,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    auditRunner: AuditableRunner,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    identityRegistry: IdentityRegistry"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  ) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    this.registry = registry;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    this.taskManager = taskManager;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    this.auditRunner = auditRunner;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    this.identityRegistry = identityRegistry;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  async delegateTask("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    fromDid: string,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    signature: string,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    targetAgent: string,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    message: AgentMessage,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    sessionId?: string"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  ): Promise<{ task: Task; audit: AuditEntry } | { error: string }> {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if (!this.identityRegistry.verify(fromDid, signature, message.id)) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      return { error: \"Identity verification failed\" };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const card = this.registry.resolve(targetAgent);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if (!card) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      return { error: `Agent ${targetAgent} not found in registry` };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const audit = await this.auditRunner.run("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      targetAgent,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      [message],"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      sessionId"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    );"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const task = await this.taskManager.sendMessage(targetAgent, message);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return { task, audit };"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  discoverAndDelegate("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    fromDid: string,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    signature: string,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    skillTag: string,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    message: AgentMessage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  ): Promise<{ task: Task; audit: AuditEntry } | { error: string }> {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    const candidates = this.registry.discoverBySkillTag(skillTag);"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    if (candidates.length === 0) {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      return Promise.resolve({"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "        error: `No agents found with skill tag: ${skillTag}`,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      });"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    return this.delegateTask("
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      fromDid,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      signature,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      candidates[0].name,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "      message"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    );"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  }"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "The gateway does four things in one call:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "1. **ANP**: Verifies the caller's identity via DID signature"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "2. **A2A**: Discovers the target agent and checks capabilities"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "3. **ACP**: Wraps the execution in an audit trail with trajectory"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "4. **A2A**: Creates a task with full lifecycle tracking"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Step 7: Wire It All Together"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "```typescript"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "async function protocolDemo() {"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  const registry = new AgentRegistry();"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "  registry.register({"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    name: \"researcher\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    description: \"Searches and summarizes findings\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "    version: \"1.0.0\","
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
